{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40690","headline":"题咸阳楼 · 李洞","name":"题咸阳楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚亚古城门，凭高黯客魂。\n塞侵秦旧国，河浸汉荒村。\n客路扬书烬，人家带水痕。\n猎频虚塚穴，耕苦露松根。\n墙外峰黏汉，冰中日晃原。\n断碑移作砌，广第灌成园。\n北马疑眠碛，南人忆钓湓。\n桥闲野鹿过，街静禁鸦翻。\n滩鼓城隍动，云冲太白昏。\n标衣多吕裔，荷锸或刘孙。\n吊问难知主，登攀强滴罇。\n不能扶壮势，冠劒惜乾坤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}